            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "{{Expand German|topic=scitech |otherarticle=Strauch-Dornlattich |date=February 2018}}"
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Launaea arborescens is a species of flowering plant in the family Asteraceae."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p3",
            "text": "Taxonomy\nThe species was first described by Jules Aimé Battandier in 1888 as Zollikoferia arborescens. It was transferred to Launaea in 1923 by Svante Samuel Murbeck."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p4",
            "text": "Distribution\nThe species occurs in Spain, the Canary Islands, Algeria, Morocco, Mauritania and Cape Verde."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
